OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Fclear this evening, leaving the rest
OL,7,Fof the night dry with clear spells for
OL,8,Fmost, allowing a frost to form in some
OL,9,Fprone spots. However, a few further
OL,10,Flight showers may reach northern and
OL,11,Fwestern coasts later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold, clear start with
OL,14,Ffrost in places. Dry and settled
OL,15,Fthrough the day for most with patchy
OL,16,Fcloud developing. The odd light shower
OL,17,Fpossible around northern and western
OL,18,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
