OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry with sunshine on Sunday, but
OL,7,Fturning cloudier across the Western
OL,8,FIsles later. Dry on Monday with
OL,9,Fsunshine, then a cloudier day likely
OL,10,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
